# Cases Template

Purpose:
  Template for module case specifications.

Cases: <MODULE_NAME>

Scenarios:
  - <scenario_name>:
      given: <precondition>
      when: <action>
      then: <expected_result>

Examples:
  - input: <input_data>
    output: <expected_output>

Rules:
  [C1] All critical paths MUST have BDD scenarios.
  [C2] Edge cases MUST be documented.
  [C3] Security scenarios MUST be included.


State: +

